of M at time tis given by", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.7070707070707071, "x1": 0.4945054945054945, "y1": 0.7202797202797203}, {"text": "og +5].", "x0": 0.4725274725274725, "y0": 0.7381507381507382, "x1": 0.5934065934065934, "y1": 0.7606837606837606}, {"text": "(d) Find the time at which the acceleration of M is zero. 3", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.7832167832167832, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.8065268065268065}, {"text": "(\u00a9) Find the minimum distance between P and Q. 4", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.8329448329448329, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.8453768453768454}], [{"text": "1", "x0": 0.49340659340659343, "y0": 0.03496503496503497, "x1": 0.5076923076923077, "y1": 0.04428904428904429}, {"text": "QUESTION 10. Use a separate Writing Booklet.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.06837606837606838, "x1": 0.532967032967033, "y1": 0.08158508158508158}, {"text": "Marks", "x0": 0.823076923076923, "y0": 0.0777000777000777, "x1": 0.8813186813186813, "y1": 0.08780108780108781}, {"text": "(a) the same set of axes, accurately draw the graphs of 5", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.11421911421911422, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.12742812742812742}, {"text": "y=sinx and y=3x for", "x0": 0.3208791208791209, "y0": 0.14607614607614608, "x1": 0.5208791208791209, "y1": 0.16317016317016317}, {"text": "(ii) Find the gradient of the tangent to y = at the origin.", "x0": 0.1824175824175824, "y0": 0.17793317793317792, "x1": 0.6747252747252748, "y1": 0.19735819735819735}, {"text": "(ii) For what values of m does the equation", "x0": 0.17692307692307693, "y0": 0.20357420357420358, "x1": 0.5384615384615384, "y1": 0.22688422688422688}, {"text": "sin.x = mx", "x0": 0.4230769230769231, "y0": 0.2400932400932401, "x1": 0.5043956043956044, "y1": 0.2501942501942502}, {"text": "have a solution in the domain 0 < x", "x0": 0.22747252747252747, "y0": 0.26884226884226886, "x1": 0.5065934065934066, "y1": 0.2789432789432789}, {"text": "(b) 5", "x0": 0.11978021978